@guide A_Wetlands
@name Wetlands
@faction Alliance
@levels 24-29
@zone Wetlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Menethil Harbor, the Excavation site, Greenwarden's grove and Dun Modr. Shared by both Alliance branches (the Kalimdor branch arrives by boat from Auberdine).
@next A_Hillsbrad

accept Young Crocolisk Skins | James Halloran, Menethil Harbor.
accept Claws from the Deep | Karl Boran on the docks.
accept The Third Fleet | First Mate Fitzsimmons in the inn.
accept The Greenwarden
accept In Search of The Excavation Team | Tarrel Rockweaver.
accept Digging Through the Ooze | Sida, west Menethil.
accept Report to Captain Stoutfist | Valstag Ironjaw, the keep.
